      "statement":"For the composite predicate: decision(holds) → satisfied when conjunction reports satisfied; decision(fails) → falsified when conjunction reports falsified and no mandatory result for that claim is satisfied; conflict → falsified when mandatory same-claim results include both satisfied and falsified, retaining the counterexample and unresolved disagreement for decision authority; indeterminate → indeterminate. Conjoin returns out_of_frame or invalid_basis directly when conjunction reports it, including basis mismatch, despite omission from the signature. Declared veto/deferral follows the reported value's applicable cause or direct return. Planned assessments without closed results and required coverage without a planned assessment are recorded beside the value, are not conjoin outcomes and map to no core value. decision(holds) is assessment, not acceptance; acceptance is separate.",
